------- OpenWECD.Qahse(HawtC3) WindL  主文件  By 赵子祯 ------------------------------------------------
NREL_5MW_OC4_Semisub 模型

==================  外部风文件类型 ==================
3      WindType - 风文件类型和功能选择 (1=steady; 2=user define; 3=binary TurbSim FF(.wnd); 4=binary Bladed(.wnd); 5=TurbSim bts(.bts))
true   CreadW - 是否循环读取风文件

================== 风参数 [used only for WindType = 1 and 2,4] =========================
11.4  HWindSpeed - Horizontal windspeed (m/s) (Bladed模式下可能需要)
87   RefHt - 参考高度(m)
0.0   PLexp          - Power law exponent                              (-)

================== 用户定义风参数 [used only for WindType = 2] ==================
-120   gridY_min  - 网格的最小
120   gridY_max - 网格横向最大值
5    gridY_step - 网格横向步长
0   gridZ_min - 网格纵向最小值
180  gridZ_max - 网格纵向最大值
5    gridZ_step - 网格纵向步长
5            WindSpeedNum  - Wind Speed Num(fomart is "t windspeed")[used only for WindType = 2]
0 10                         - WindSpeedList
30 10
100 15
600 50
1200 200

================== TurbSim .wnd 风文件参数 [used only for WindType = 3] ==================
"../SimWind/result/NREL_5MW_OC4_Semisub_Demo_wind.ts.wnd"    - TurWindFilePath   - Rootname of the full-field wind file to use (.wnd, .sum)

================== Bladed .wnd 风文件参数 [used only for WindType = 4] ==================
"../SimWind/result/NREL_5MW_OC4_Semisub_Demo_wind.wnd"    - BldWindFilePath   - Rootname of the full-field wind file to use (.wnd)

================== TurbSim .bts 风文件参数 [used only for WindType = 5] ==================
"../SimWind/result/NREL_5MW_OC4_Semisub_Demo_wind.bts"    - IECWindFilePath   - Rootname of the full-field wind file to use (.wnd)


====================== OUTPUT ==================================================


END of input file (the word "END" must appear in the first 3 columns of this last OutList - 以下为输出通道列表
